```text
F. Town of Pine Bluffs – Electric System Improvements

$3,000,000 for voltage conversion and substation reconstruction to modernize the electric
grid, improve reliability, enhance safety, and support future residential and commercial
growth.

G. City of Cheyenne – Downtown Improvement Project

$4,000,000 to the City of Cheyenne for downtown improvements and maintenance to
