replacing facility built in 1949, enhancing emergency response, efficiency, and modern
operational capabilities.

E. Laramie County Fire District #6

$5,543,716 for a new Fire Station and Headquarters near Hillsdale. The new headquarters
enhance safety through improved capacity, modern infrastructure and better emergency
capabilities.

